---
import BaseHead from '../../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Header from '../../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';
import { SITE_TITLE, PHONE, PHONE_TEL } from '../../consts';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
	<BaseHead title={`Sewer Camera Inspection Sunnyvale CA | ${SITE_TITLE}`} description="Video camera drain and sewer inspection in Sunnyvale, CA. Locate clogs, cracks, roots, and damage with precision before recommending repairs." />
</head>
<body>
	<Header />

	<section class="page-hero">
		<div class="container">
			<h1>Camera Inspection in Sunnyvale</h1>
			<p>See exactly what’s happening inside your drains and sewer lines with high-resolution video inspection.</p>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="content">
		<div class="container">
			<div class="content-grid">
				<div>
					<h2>Know Before You Dig or Repair</h2>
					<p>Guessing at the cause of a drain or sewer problem can lead to unnecessary work and expense. A video camera inspection lets us travel the full length of the line, locate the exact issue, and show you the footage so you understand the condition of your plumbing.</p>
					<p>This is especially valuable in older Sunnyvale and Silicon Valley homes where clay, cast-iron, or Orangeburg laterals may have settled, cracked, or been invaded by roots.</p>
					
					<h3>What Camera Inspection Reveals</h3>
					<ul>
						<li>Exact location of clogs and blockages</li>
						<li>Tree root intrusion</li>
						<li>Cracks, offsets, and collapsed sections</li>
						<li>Bellies (low spots) that hold water and debris</li>
						<li>Scale, grease, and debris buildup</li>
						<li>Condition of joints and pipe material</li>
					</ul>
				</div>
				<div>
					<h3>When to Get an Inspection</h3>
					<p>Camera inspections are recommended before buying a home, after repeated clogs, when planning a remodel that affects plumbing, or whenever you want a clear picture of your sewer lateral’s health.</p>
					
					<h3>Clear Report & Recommendations</h3>
					<p>You receive a clear explanation of findings and prioritized recommendations — from simple cleaning to targeted repair options — so you can make an informed decision.</p>
					
					<div class="mt-2">
						<a href="/contact/" class="btn btn-primary">Schedule Camera Inspection</a>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="cta">
		<div class="container">
			<h2>See What’s Inside Your Pipes</h2>
			<p>Call to schedule a video camera inspection in Sunnyvale or nearby communities.</p>
			<a href={`tel:${PHONE_TEL}`} class="btn btn-primary">Call {PHONE}</a>
		</div>
	</section>

	<Footer />
</body>
</html>
